- Live inventory parsing dated 2026-08-30 resolves `Blue Chamomile EO` and `Juniper Berry EO` as owned, implicit-neat, carrier-free, and `execution_ready=true`. This establishes current stock basis, not lot identity, composition, density, safety, or sensory quality.
- Juniper Berry has local composite-natural decomposition but conflicting cross-source whole-oil VP metadata (`65 Pa` data-spine versus `0.5 Pa` ingredient profile). Blue Chamomile has local whole-oil proxy physics but no composite-natural decomposition. Numerical natural-OAV results are therefore diagnostic and explicitly partial.
